    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="36">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 36</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif preost on gesetne timan tída ne ringe oððe tida ne singe, gebete þæt.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a priest does not ring the hours or sing the hours at the appointed time, he is to compensate for it.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a priest does not ring or sing the canonical hours at the set time, he is to atone for that.</ab>
      </div>
